      "title": "1 · ⚪ SOURCE: 'created_at' default",
      "description": "**Source:** a string literal, used only when `filters.orderColumn` is falsy (no `sort` in the query, or `sort=`).\n\n**Value here:** `'created_at'` for `GET /orders` (derived from code, not run).\n\n**Next →** passed as the third argument of `find`, received as `orderBy` (step 7).",
