      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3 · 🛡 Check on the path: requireAuth",
      "description": "**Control:** `requireAuth` requires a Bearer token found in `users.api_token`. It decides **who** can send `sort` (every authenticated user: alice, bob, admin), not **what** it contains. There is no `requireRole` on this route.\n\n**Next →** the `status` allowlist (step 4).",
      "file": "src/routes/orders.js",
      "pattern": "router\\.get\\('/orders', (requireAuth)",
      "selection": {
