    {
      "title": "4 · 🚫 Check on the path: status allowlist",
      "description": "**Gap:** the only validation in the controller checks `status` against `['open', 'shipped', 'cancelled']`. Nothing checks `sort`: no allowlist of columns, no type check, no length limit.\n\n**Next →** `sort` is renamed `orderColumn` (step 5).",
      "file": "src/controllers/ordersController.js",
      "pattern": "(if \\(status && !ALLOWED_STATUSES\\.includes\\(status\\)\\))",
