      "description": "**Propagates:** the third argument is named `orderBy` in the repository. `find` has one caller (`orderService.search`).\n\n**Value here:** `orderBy = 'total'`, or `'created_at'` from path B (derived from code, not run).\n\n**Next →** interpolated into the SQL text (step 8).",
